<LVClass LVVersion="20008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.ContainingLib" Type="Str">ZM-ROOT-root.lvlib</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.ContainingLibPath" Type="Str">../../ZM-ROOT-root.lvlib</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Root actor: launches the communication manager and the hardware manager, routes every package by destination (Communication to the CM, an error package for Root to its panel, Unknown and Hardware dropped with a log line), and shows the Stop button and the errors list. Error-handling plan: none yet; an error stops the root and, through AF's Stop Core, the tree.</Property>
